---
/**
 * SEOGalleryContent.astro
 * Static SEO-enriching content block for /gallery/
 * Renders as pure server-side HTML — no client JS needed.
 */
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white border-t border-[#2C3531]/10">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#c9a832] uppercase block mb-2">
        Visual Tour
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B3322]">
        Explore Every Corner of Whispering Pines Resort
      </h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-[2px] bg-[#c9a832] mx-auto mt-4 mb-6"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">

      <!-- Rooms & Suites -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-4">
          Rooms, Suites & Cottage Interiors
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Browse interiors of our four distinct room categories — the Deluxe Skylight Suite with its cathedral wood-paneled ceiling and stargazing roof window, the stone-walled Heritage Cottage Rooms with hand-crafted Kumaoni furniture and geo-heaters, the Family Twin Rooms with direct orchard-level access and twin double beds, and the Cedar Group Rooms designed for extended families. Every room features premium bedding, en-suite bathrooms with rain showers, and private mountain-facing balconies finished in cedar pine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Private Villa -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-4">
          The Premium 3-Bedroom Private Villa
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Our flagship accommodation — the Whispering Pines Private Villa — is a standalone stone-and-cedar heritage estate surrounded by peach and plum orchards. The gallery showcases the villa's expansive living room with its wood-burning stone hearth fireplace, the fully-equipped modular kitchen, three bedrooms across two floors including the dramatic attic suite, private gated driveway for 3-4 vehicles, and enclosed garden lawns. This is the most sought-after private villa near Nainital for families, groups, and celebrations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dining -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-4">
          Dining, Restaurant & Cafe Spaces
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          View our multi-cuisine in-house restaurant, the open-air terrace dining setup overlooking the Himalayan ridge, and the poolside refreshment area. The kitchen prepares farm-to-table Kumaoni specialties using locally sourced organic vegetables alongside North Indian, Chinese, and Continental dishes. Private dining arrangements for honeymoon couples, family celebrations, and corporate dinners can be set up on the front lawns or the terrace — both visible in the gallery images.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Outdoors & Views -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] leading-tight mb-4">
          Outdoor Views, Gardens & Pine Forest Trails
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3531]/80 font-sans text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          The outdoor gallery captures the signature 180° Himalayan panorama visible from every room — the Nanda Devi, Trishul, and Panchachuli peaks at sunrise and golden hour. You'll also see the property's pine forest walking paths, the working peach and apple orchards adjacent to the villa, the outdoor bonfire and barbecue area, the swimming pool set under the pine and oak forest canopy, and the secure pet-friendly enclosed lawns. These images represent the actual, unfiltered experience — no stock photography, no borrowed scenery.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Trust Note -->
    <div class="mt-16 bg-[#FAF9F6] border-l-4 border-[#c9a832] p-6 md:p-8 rounded-r-sm shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#1B3322] uppercase font-bold">
          Authenticity Promise
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[#2C3531]/90 font-sans italic text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed m-0">
        Every photograph in this gallery was taken on the Whispering Pines Resort property in Malla Ramgarh, Uttarakhand. We do not use stock images, computer-generated renders, or photos from other properties. What you see here is exactly what you will experience during your stay.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
